<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Julius Baer cut at CSFB.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Julius Baer cut at CSFB.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Julius Baer Group was cut to &quot;hold&quot; from &quot;buy&quot; at CS First Boston, the investment bank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>CSFB analyst Madeleine Hoffman highlighted the recent outperformance of the stock and said she did not expect further outperformance in the next 12 months.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
